<speak>It's good that you've made room for this conversation rather than trying to manage it while people are coming in and out of your office. I'll take the main points in sequence. So your objective is to free up money from your existing holding for upcoming household commitments and simplify your remaining portfolio. Please bear in mind that you could lose part or even all of the money you invested. Are you willing to accept an investment loss when reducing this holding to meet your liquidity needs?</speak>